                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kan ealu ayi mir adege, awinjo yedi ma kwo mir adege wacu kumae, Bin inen. E aneno, man nen, riuni ma col; man ng’atu m’ubedo i wie mukero ni i cinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man awinjo calu dwal uwacu kumae i kind yedi ma kwo ang’wen, Mukero mi nganu mi denarius, man nganu ma tung’ mukero adek mi denarius; man mo ku pigulok re kud wudubi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
